WEBVTT

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:20.930
THREE MEN, A LITTLE GIRL,
A POLICE OFFICER AND A DOG

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:22.770
<i>I don't have any friends.</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:23.690
See you!

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:24.940
<i>I mean zero friends.</i>

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.860
<i>Because I'm totally different</i>
<i>from other people.</i>

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:28.320
<i>I'm an entirely different creature.</i>

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:30.650
<i>How could you make friends</i>
<i>in that situation?</i>

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:32.360
<i>In spite of that...</i>

00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:35.490
Hey, dude!
Let's go eat some ramen noodles.

00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:38.080
Come with me, Saiki.
I feel disturbance in the air.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.120
<i>Two people are stalking me now.</i>

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.210
<i>It sucks. I have lived</i>
<i>trying not to draw attention.</i>

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:46.330
-Why are you following us?
<i>-Should I change schools?</i>

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:48.500
You wanna eat ramen noodles with us?

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:50.670
<i>I never said I would.</i>
<i>Just go slurp them by yourself.</i>

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:53.050
You're the one following us.

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:55.880
We are going to investigate
the disturbance in the air.

00:00:55.970 --> 00:00:57.220
Get lost!

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:59.140
<i>I never said I would.</i>
<i>Just go feel it by yourself.</i>

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:02.270
Huh? You get lost! We're gonna eat ramen!

00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:04.770
Go eat by yourself! Let's go, Saiki!
I can feel it's getting worse.

00:01:04.850 --> 00:01:06.940
-We're gonna eat ramen!
-We gotta settle it down!

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:08.230
<i>I never said I would!</i>

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:10.570
<i>It looks like they're</i>
<i>going out of business soon.</i>

00:01:10.650 --> 00:01:12.990
Saiki, how come you're friends with him?

00:01:13.070 --> 00:01:15.610
I'm telling you as your partner,
you should give it a second thought.

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:16.780
<i>I'm not your partner.</i>

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:20.990
Dude, you should quit being his friend.
I'm telling ya as your BFF.

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>I'm not your BFF. Why don't you guys</i>
<i>become friends with each other, then?</i>

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:29.000
<i>There's a little girl.</i>

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:31.500
-She's crying. I'll talk to her.
<i>-Stop, idiot!</i>

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:34.460
<i>Haven't you seen your face? I don't want</i>
<i>to hear her personal alarm going off.</i>

00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:37.430
What's wrong? Were you bullied?

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:40.640
Here, use this. It's okay.

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:44.930
What is the matter, little girl?
Talk to me!

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:47.640
-My Wind is gone.
-Wind?

00:01:48.150 --> 00:01:49.480
-My puppy.
-A dog?

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:51.570
I had him tied to that,

00:01:51.650 --> 00:01:53.280
but he's gone.

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:56.110
All right, we'll find your dog for you!

00:01:56.190 --> 00:01:58.240
<i>Don't involve me.</i>

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:00.200
<i>Hey, she is turning on her personal alarm!</i>

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:01.660
<i>Stop her!</i>

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:03.990
He looks scary, but no need to worry.

00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:06.120
-I suppose.
-What do you mean?

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:07.960
What have I done to you?

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:09.880
You're scaring her.

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:13.090
-With your guilty face.
-Whose face is guilty?

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:16.670
Bring it on! We'll find her dog first.
Come on, dude!

00:02:18.090 --> 00:02:19.380
<i>See you tomorrow, Nendou.</i>

00:02:19.470 --> 00:02:22.180
Idiot! He didn't even ask
what kind of dog it is.

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:24.510
Now, tell me what it looks like.

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:26.600
-Um...
<i>-So, he's not as stupid as Nendou is.</i>

00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:28.940
-Okay, this is what it looks like.
-<i>It's not okay.</i>

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:31.520
Okay, Saiki! Let's make copies of this
and post them everywhere!

00:02:31.940 --> 00:02:33.610
<i>-Let's go home.</i>
-Hey,

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:35.400
will Wind be found?

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:37.440
You all will find him, right?

00:02:38.990 --> 00:02:40.950
<i>Since I heard about it, I can't ignore it.</i>

00:02:41.030 --> 00:02:43.160
<i>Oh, well, how about thoughtography?</i>

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:45.790
<i>Thoughtography is an ability</i>
<i>to burn images onto paper.</i>

00:02:45.870 --> 00:02:49.670
<i>But if I thought about something else,</i>
<i>that would be burned onto it.</i>

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:53.590
<i>Failed. My dad's face came across my mind.</i>

00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:55.460
<i>Looks like he's doing well at work.</i>

00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:59.420
<i>One more time. Lost dog, lost dog,</i>
<i>lost dog, lost do... </i>

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:01.010
<i>What's he doing?</i>

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:04.220
<i>Jeez, one more time. Nendou is so useless.</i>

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:05.640
<i>I can count on Kaidou a bit...</i>

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:07.770
<i>Not him either.</i>

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:12.730
<i>Phew, I finally made it. But...</i>

00:03:12.810 --> 00:03:14.690
<i>it's not easy to pinpoint the location.</i>

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:17.230
SAKAMOTO ROAD

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:20.650
Wind! I was worried about you!

00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:22.110
<i>Well, I'm relieved.</i>

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:23.820
Thank you!

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:27.330
<i>Say that to them.</i>
<i>I found the dog thanks to them.</i>

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:30.120
<i>Their contribution is</i>
<i>about one percent, though.</i>

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:32.670
<i>It just happened to be near Nendou.</i>

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:34.500
<i>I could locate Nendou</i>
<i>with my second sight.</i>

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:36.750
<i>And Kaidou was useful somehow.</i>

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:37.880
He makes me sick.

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:41.550
<i>If Kaidou didn't make a fuss,</i>
<i>the officer would have taken the dog away.</i>

00:03:42.010 --> 00:03:43.390
-Dude!
-Saiki!

00:03:43.470 --> 00:03:45.720
<i>Who would have expected they'd help me?</i>

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:48.310
<i>I'm sure that they never</i>
<i>thought they would.</i>

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:50.270
I never thought the police
would get involved.

00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:52.520
Thank you, guys!

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:54.520
What? I found one, too.

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:56.570
-Then, whose dog is this?
<i>-His.</i>

00:03:56.650 --> 00:03:58.480
You! The dog thief!

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:00.240
Hey, what are you doing? Ouch!

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:01.780
Don't you need to help your friend?

00:04:01.860 --> 00:04:04.410
<i>Friend? No, that's wrong.</i>

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:06.950
<i>We are different types of life-forms.</i>

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:08.370
<i>Friendship isn't possible.</i>

00:04:08.450 --> 00:04:11.830
Wind and I have been friends
since I was little.

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:16.420
Saiki and I have been friends, too.

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:17.500
BFFs!

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:25.890
SIGN IN TO THE GAME WORLD

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:27.640
<i>One day during summer vacation.</i>

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:29.930
Whoa! You scared me! Knock for once!

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:32.140
<i>What are you mumbling about all alone?</i>
<i>Have you finally gone senile?</i>

00:04:32.230 --> 00:04:34.640
I'm not alone. It's an online game. See?

00:04:34.730 --> 00:04:36.940
<i>-What is that game?</i>
-You've never heard of <i>Alien Buster?</i>

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:38.610
CO-OP WITH FRIENDS
DEFEAT ALIENS TO CREATE POWERFUL WEAPONS!

00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:40.690
You work together online
to defeat alien invaders.

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:42.110
You gather materials by defeating them

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:44.030
to craft powerful weapons.
It's a hunting adventure.

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:45.410
<i>So it's basically like </i>Monster Hunter?

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:48.070
You're just saying it?
I specifically avoided saying that name!

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:49.580
<i>-Anyway, are you all right?</i>
-Huh? What about?

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:51.620
<i>Your character is</i>
<i>getting bustered by an alien.</i>

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:54.920
Oh, crap! Why didn't you say so sooner?
Warn me, why don't you?!

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:56.790
<i>Like I care.</i>

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:59.420
But check this out. It's co-op,
so everybody comforts me. Cool, huh?

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:00.750
KENJI: DON'T WORRY!
KURONEKO: BETTER LUCK NEXT TIME!

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:03.130
Maybe you could get along with people
through chatting like this, Kusuo.

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:05.220
<i>That's true.</i>
<i>You can't hear them think things like,</i>

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:07.390
<i>"you screwed up" or "you useless trash"</i>
<i>about you on screen.</i>

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:10.220
<i>Stop that! They're not thinking that!</i>
<i>Let's see. I better...</i>

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:11.310
That's good.

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:12.270
<i>What's good about it?</i>

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:15.140
Oh, this?
Well, I made my character a girl,

00:05:15.230 --> 00:05:16.480
so everyone thinks I'm a girl,

00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:18.270
<i>-</i>so I have to pretend and all...
<i>-Oh, really?</i>

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:19.650
Stop it!
Don't look at your father like that!

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:22.570
The online world's complicated!
Oh, my phone.

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:25.450
What? Mr. Numehiko Manpukuji's comic
might not make the latest issue?

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:27.110
But he's doing the cover!
I understand! I'll be right there!

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:28.030
<i>That sounds boring.</i>

00:05:28.110 --> 00:05:30.200
Kusuo! Take over the game for me!

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:31.120
<i>Huh? Why?</i>

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:35.000
There's an event quest going on. If I
miss this, I'll never get the rare item!

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:36.500
<i>I've never played before.</i>

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:39.040
It's fine. My party members are strong,
so you can just stand around.

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:41.040
It's a co-op game,
so everyone gets the reward.

00:05:41.130 --> 00:05:42.090
<i>Don't you mean a leeching game?</i>

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:44.050
Please!
I'll buy your favorite coffee jelly!

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:48.090
<i>-Good grief, why am I doing this?</i>
-Kurumi? Did you fall asleep?

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:50.050
<i>Oh, well.</i>
<i>It's summer vacation and I'm bored.</i>

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:52.390
<i>Let's see. How do you do this?</i>

00:05:52.470 --> 00:05:54.220
-Welcome back!
-You stopped responding so I was worried.

00:05:54.310 --> 00:05:56.940
<i>They're talking to me.</i>
<i>Should I respond?</i>

00:05:58.020 --> 00:06:00.150
<i>-I'm fine.</i>
-You're talking weird.

00:06:00.230 --> 00:06:01.980
-You quit your usual cute way of talking?
<i>-I'm a guy.</i>

00:06:02.070 --> 00:06:02.900
CARLOS LOGGED OUT
PISUKE LOGGED OUT

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:05.990
<i>Everyone was having so much fun</i>
<i>and yet they all disappeared somewhere.</i>

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:07.650
Yume Yume, you're too cute!

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:09.450
-Stop.
-I love how ditzy you are.

00:06:09.530 --> 00:06:10.780
-Don't tease me like that.
-So cute.

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:12.950
I forgot my resources for Super Speed
Potion! Can someone give me?

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:14.410
-I'll give you some. A present!
<i>-I see.</i>

00:06:14.490 --> 00:06:17.370
<i>Now I know why they left.</i>
<i>It's because I'm not a girl.</i>

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:20.830
<i>Girls get pandered more.</i>
<i>He definitely knew what he was doing.</i>

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:26.170
<i>But I'm stuck now. I'll have to find</i>
<i>a new ally I can leech off of.</i>

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:27.300
Want to do the event quest?

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:31.720
<i>Someone's talking to me. This is perfect,</i>
<i>but I don't know how to act like a girl.</i>

00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:33.180
<i>Huh? Maybe with this...</i>

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:36.520
-Good. Glad to work with you.
<i>-It worked. I can do this.</i>

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:37.980
<i>Good, now I have a companion.</i>

00:06:38.060 --> 00:06:39.560
My name is Ryuki Kokuenbu.

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:41.650
<i>His character name is</i>
<i>unbelievably embarrassing, though.</i>

00:06:41.730 --> 00:06:44.270
<i>He's probably a junior high kid.</i>
<i>Well, it's summer vacation. Let's go.</i>

00:06:44.360 --> 00:06:46.110
-Hey, where are you going?
<i>-Where? The event quest.</i>

00:06:46.190 --> 00:06:48.610
The event quest can't be played
without four people.

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:50.610
Don't you know that?
Are you in elementary school?

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:52.570
<i>-This guy--</i>
-We need two more warriors of light.

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:54.780
<i>Two more? Nobody else seems free.</i>

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:56.700
-Huh? What's that?
<i>-What's his problem?</i>

00:06:56.790 --> 00:06:58.750
There! Our third warrior of light!

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:00.620
-Disgusting.
-Ban him already, moderators.

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:03.420
-Your character's cute!
<i>-Let's avoid him.</i>

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:05.880
<i>Are you a girl? You're a girl, right?</i>
<i>I'm T-ta! I live in...</i>

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:08.090
<i>Your character's... My...</i>

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:09.720
<i>With everything censored,</i>
<i>I can't tell what he's saying.</i>

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:12.300
<i>This is someone to avoid</i>
<i>at all costs in real life.</i>

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:14.800
<i>But we're still missing someone.</i>
<i>What can we do?</i>

00:07:14.890 --> 00:07:16.770
<i>-What about our last member, you say?</i>
<i>-Don't you have a keyboard?</i>

00:07:16.850 --> 00:07:18.980
-Very well. We'll just have to ask him.
<i>-Him?</i>

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:21.770
-The top player of this game, Tiga.
<i>-Top player?</i>

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:24.650
<i>Even as a novice</i>
<i>I can tell his gear is top level.</i>

00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:26.690
<i>But would someone like that group with us?</i>

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:27.730
It's possible. Let's try.

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:30.650
You want me to help you?
Don't make me laugh.

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:32.030
<i>-Who's this? He seems arrogant.</i>
-Little scrubs like you

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:33.450
should go home and drink your yogurt.

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:36.830
<i>Well, he's a top player and we're a poser,</i>
<i>a junior high student, and a pervert.</i>

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:39.370
Do you get it? His skills are top notch,

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:42.040
but because of his attitude,
no one will group with him.

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:43.120
Hey, I hear you, bastard!

00:07:43.210 --> 00:07:45.540
Ignore that. Please help.
Don't you want to do the event quest?

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:47.550
-Then do On Hands and Knees!
<i>-On Hands and Knees? What's that?</i>

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:49.210
You can't expect any of us to have
On Hands and Knees!

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:50.130
What's On Hands and Knees?

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:54.140
It's a hidden emote that you only unlock
after running from battle 10,000 times.

00:07:54.220 --> 00:07:58.060
-Running 10,000 times?
-It's so tedious that few people have it.

00:07:58.140 --> 00:07:59.890
<i>-You mean this?</i>
-What?

00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:01.940
-You actually have it?
-I've never seen it before!

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:04.810
<i>It was just there in the menu. You can</i>
<i>thank the original player's play style.</i>

00:08:04.900 --> 00:08:06.520
Looks like you're helping us then.

00:08:07.190 --> 00:08:09.280
Okay, then the four of us can
take on the event quest!

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:12.990
<i>This user account was suspended</i>
<i>due to improper remarks.</i>

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:14.990
<i>What is this game?</i>

00:08:15.070 --> 00:08:17.490
Thanks a lot, T-ta!
This is why I hate summer vacation!

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:18.410
RYUKI

00:08:18.490 --> 00:08:19.370
Stupid scrub.

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:20.330
T-TA

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:21.450
I got banned. Well, time for a nap.

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:25.500
<i>I didn't get the item?</i>
<i>And all my friends have blocked me! Why?</i>

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:30.960
PUBLISHING CRISIS?
WORKING AT SHUENSHA

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:32.420
I'm leaving now.

00:08:32.510 --> 00:08:34.010
You're leaving so early this morning.

00:08:34.090 --> 00:08:36.470
Yeah, I have an important job to do.

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:37.720
I may be home late tonight.

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:39.180
Oh, your face is red.

00:08:39.260 --> 00:08:43.180
I'm blushing because I have
such a pretty wife sending me off.

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:47.020
I'll always be a sixth grader
in front of you.

00:08:47.110 --> 00:08:48.610
Oh, please.

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:51.440
-Oh, honey! You have a high fever!
-<i>What?</i>

00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:54.280
-Saiki isn't here yet?
-No, he doesn't answer the phone, either.

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:55.490
EDITOR-IN-CHIEF: ONIMATSU

00:08:55.570 --> 00:08:56.910
What the hell is he doing?

00:08:56.990 --> 00:08:57.910
Saiki! You're late!

00:08:57.990 --> 00:09:01.160
-You know how important today is?
<i>-Why should I?</i>

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:04.790
<i>Because I'm not Kuniharu Saiki,</i>
<i>but Kusuo Saiki.</i>

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:07.420
Please. I could be fired
if I don't go in today.

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:10.250
<i>Are you expecting my restoring ability?</i>
<i>No way.</i>

00:09:10.340 --> 00:09:12.760
Yeah, even if I get well,
I may be sick again tomorrow.

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:15.010
<i>Remember last night,</i>
<i>when the date was changing?</i>

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:17.340
<i>Shut up. Restoration is once a day.</i>

00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:19.470
Anyways, please...

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:22.390
Honey! Answer me! No!

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:25.520
<i>We swapped bodies</i>
<i>after he became unconscious.</i>

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:28.770
<i>I am totally fine,</i>
<i>no matter how high the fever is.</i>

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:32.190
<i>He is inside my body</i>
<i>and will tell me what to do at work.</i>

00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:33.320
<i>The idiot is you.</i>

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:35.740
<i>If Dad can do it, anyone can do it.</i>

00:09:35.820 --> 00:09:38.570
Saiki, what're you waiting for?
Just lick my shoes!

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:40.410
<i>Let me correct that. Working is hard.</i>

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:43.080
-Boss, you'd better...
-Right.

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:45.210
Bring me Mr. Azuma's drafts
for the final episode.

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:46.620
<i>Drafts? What's he talking about?</i>

00:09:46.710 --> 00:09:49.330
<i>Oh, I'm supposed to go pick up drafts</i>
<i>for the final episode</i>

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:52.550
<i>of </i>Santaro, If Possible
<i>from Mr. Azuma today.</i>

00:09:52.630 --> 00:09:53.510
<i>Oh, it's going to end?</i>

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:58.010
Yeah, after 13 years of being serialized
in the <i>Shonen Scotch</i> magazine.

00:09:58.090 --> 00:09:59.390
<i>That's too long.</i>

00:09:59.470 --> 00:10:01.720
<i>So, you don't have the drafts here, right?</i>

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:03.640
<i>Right, so you have to try</i>
<i>not to make the boss mad--</i>

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:05.560
<i>-I don't have them.</i>
-Huh? What is your problem?

00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:09.440
Deadline is today. We've been announcing
that it's ending for five weeks!

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:10.520
<i>Calm down, both of you.</i>

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:13.360
-Go get it fast, or you will be fired!
<i>-Oh, what a black company.</i>

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:15.530
Hurry up, asshole!

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:17.490
What?

00:10:17.570 --> 00:10:19.320
-What do you want?
<i>-Calm down!</i>

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:21.570
-Oh, well, work is so stressful.
<i>-Please calm down!</i>

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:23.450
<i>That's okay. I can forgive you.</i>

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:26.750
What was that destructive noise?

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:29.000
-What did you do?
<i>-Right, uncontrollable in this body.</i>

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:30.420
AZUMA

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:33.840
<i>Wasn't there anyone else</i>
<i>who could pick it up?</i>

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:36.380
Don't be silly. For artists,
their work is like their baby.

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:39.930
You can't even touch their work
without establishing trust first.

00:10:40.010 --> 00:10:42.930
<i>-Is that so?</i>
-He won't give it to anyone but me.

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:45.140
-Get lost.
<i>-Established what?</i>

00:10:45.220 --> 00:10:47.390
<i>Take the thing in your pocket out</i>
<i>and give it to him, now!</i>

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:48.480
ONIGIRI

00:10:48.560 --> 00:10:52.230
<i>Mr. Azuma won't let me in</i>
<i>until I give him something to eat.</i>

00:10:54.360 --> 00:10:55.780
-Come in.
<i>-I wish I could leave now.</i>

00:10:56.480 --> 00:10:57.740
<i>So, this is his office.</i>

00:10:58.650 --> 00:11:00.200
<i>He looks so grumpy.</i>

00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:03.160
<i>We've already been working together</i>
<i>for more than five years.</i>

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:05.660
<i>Our relationship is more than just</i>
<i>a business, it's now like comrades.</i>

00:11:05.740 --> 00:11:08.120
<i>-Whenever we see each other...</i>
-Are you here for the drafts, Mr. Saionji?

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:09.500
<i>He doesn't even know your name.</i>

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:11.370
<i>-My name is Saiki!</i>
-Saiki?

00:11:11.460 --> 00:11:12.500
Do you know him?

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:15.090
He is an editor who works with you
and always tells dirty jokes.

00:11:15.170 --> 00:11:16.300
<i>-Yes, that's me!</i>
<i>-Seriously?</i>

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:18.170
<i>Let's get his drafts, anyway.</i>

00:11:18.260 --> 00:11:19.380
<i>Right, I almost forgot. Give it to me.</i>

00:11:19.470 --> 00:11:20.630
What is it?

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:23.760
<i>He looks so down and out all of a sudden.</i>

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:25.560
<i>Oh, no. He's not finished his work yet.</i>

00:11:25.640 --> 00:11:27.060
<i>I can tell because</i>
<i>of our long relationship.</i>

00:11:27.140 --> 00:11:28.100
<i>It's so obvious, even to me.</i>

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:31.350
<i>Now, he is showing me five pieces</i>
<i>of blank paper like a dead man.</i>

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:33.860
<i>Five pages? Tell him!</i>
<i>"Mr. Azuma! It's due today.</i>

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:36.610
<i>The series will be on hiatus!"</i>

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:39.190
<i>I told him. And it seems</i>
<i>like he's given up on everything.</i>

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:41.320
<i>-That means he gave up!</i>
<i>-That's what I said.</i>

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:44.160
It's over. We have less
than four hours left. I'm fired.

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:45.530
<i>Don't look so pitiful with my face.</i>

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:46.990
<i>I can make him do it.</i>

00:11:47.580 --> 00:11:48.700
<i>Restoration!</i>

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:51.210
<i>Looks like he hasn't slept for days.</i>

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:53.920
<i>He should feel better</i>
<i>after a 24-hour restoration.</i>

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:57.800
Sleepiness and exhaustion have gone!
I can work now!

00:11:58.210 --> 00:12:00.090
<i>He's feeling even better than I intended.</i>

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:02.630
I have five more pages!
Saiki-kun, I need your help!

00:12:02.720 --> 00:12:03.840
<i>No way. I have never read it.</i>

00:12:04.930 --> 00:12:08.060
<i>But I can remove irrelevant thoughts</i>
<i>which interfere with creative thinking.</i>

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:09.930
I got it! Sayuri and Rensuke get together,

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:13.350
and Santaro targets their daughter!
This is it!

00:12:13.440 --> 00:12:15.610
<i>-Is he sure about that? Well, whatever.</i>
-I'll do it!

00:12:16.110 --> 00:12:18.070
<i>Immediate telepathy and thoughtography.</i>

00:12:18.150 --> 00:12:20.110
<i>It's a combined technique.</i>

00:12:20.610 --> 00:12:23.150
<i>I read his mind with immediate telepathy</i>

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:25.030
<i>and burn the images onto paper</i>
<i>with thoughtography.</i>

00:12:25.110 --> 00:12:28.240
-I'll finish the last five pages!
<i>-Let's teleport to the office.</i>

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:30.950
I finished! What? It's already there?

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:35.960
PROUD MOM OF A SON!
MOM'S MEETUP

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:37.500
CAFE MAMI

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:40.880
<i>This cafe's coffee</i>
<i>and coffee jelly are not bad at all.</i>

00:12:41.510 --> 00:12:44.470
<i>This is the happiest time</i>
<i>as I'm free from Nendou, Kaidou</i>

00:12:44.550 --> 00:12:45.930
<i>and my family after school.</i>

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:49.100
<i>This peaceful me time with desserts</i>
<i>cannot be replaced with anything.</i>

00:12:50.470 --> 00:12:52.350
-Welcome.
-Any seats available?

00:12:52.430 --> 00:12:54.560
<i>-Oh, well. I hid myself before I knew it.</i>
-How many?

00:12:55.190 --> 00:12:56.900
-How many are we?
-Three.

00:12:56.980 --> 00:12:59.020
Smoking, please. Sorry, I'm a smoker.

00:12:59.110 --> 00:13:01.480
<i>I'm free from Nendou and Kaidou,</i>

00:13:01.570 --> 00:13:03.360
<i>and now here are their moms.</i>

00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:06.160
-Are you ready to order?
-Coffee, please. Black.

00:13:06.240 --> 00:13:08.530
-Iced cafe latte, please.
-Vodka on the rocks.

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:11.910
-This is a cafe, ma'am.
-It's still early in the evening.

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:14.500
A housewife can't live without drinking.

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:16.170
<i>-What the hell?</i>
-I want some cake.

00:13:16.250 --> 00:13:18.040
<i>Oh, Mom said there's</i>
<i>a parents meeting today.</i>

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:19.840
<i>I don't think Mom</i>
<i>should hang out with them.</i>

00:13:19.920 --> 00:13:21.960
-How old are you, Mrs. Saiki?
<i>-Let's see how things go.</i>

00:13:22.050 --> 00:13:23.670
I'm 37 years old.

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:25.470
You look younger.

00:13:25.550 --> 00:13:27.720
Mrs. Kaidou, you are about the same age,
aren't you?

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:29.390
I'm over 40.

00:13:29.470 --> 00:13:31.390
-I can't believe it!
-How about you, Mrs. Nendou?

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:32.560
I'm 32.

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:34.480
-Thirty-two?
<i>-Are you the youngest?</i>

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:36.190
How old were you when you gave birth?

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:40.020
It's not surprising at all.

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:41.520
We were both young.

00:13:41.610 --> 00:13:43.230
<i>The youngest one shouldn't be</i>
<i>that dignified.</i>

00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:44.490
I heard that your husband...

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:46.570
Yeah, he'd died before Riki was born.

00:13:46.650 --> 00:13:48.280
I think he was 17.

00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:50.280
Then, how old was he?
He was still in middle school?

00:13:50.370 --> 00:13:53.370
-So, I didn't get married to Take-chan.
-Take-chan?

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:58.080
-Riki's dad's last name was Takeuchi.
<i>-Riki could have been Riki Takeuchi!</i>

00:13:58.170 --> 00:14:00.630
He died before we got married,
so I named my son after him.

00:14:00.710 --> 00:14:01.670
RIKI TAKEUCHI, AGE 17

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:04.510
<i>So, he was Riki Takeuchi after all!</i>

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:06.630
So, you raised him all by yourself.

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:09.390
And he is such a smart kid. Amazing!

00:14:09.470 --> 00:14:12.720
<i>What? Oh, I see.</i>
<i>She still hasn't figured it out.</i>

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:15.480
<i>I wish you could tell me</i>
<i>how you have educated him.</i>

00:14:15.560 --> 00:14:18.060
I have never told him to study.

00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:20.440
<i>Don't behave like some mom</i>
<i>of a student at the University of Tokyo.</i>

00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:23.320
-My son is hopeless.
-Why? He is a great kid.

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:24.400
<i>He is clumsy.</i>

00:14:24.480 --> 00:14:25.490
THE ELDEST SON: SHUN
THE ELDEST DAUGHTER: SORA

00:14:25.570 --> 00:14:26.400
THE SECOND SON: TOKI

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:29.280
<i>He is the eldest child, but it took him</i>
<i>the longest to learn everything.</i>

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:32.580
<i>-But he can greet with anyone he just met.</i>
-I am the Jet-Black Wings.

00:14:33.240 --> 00:14:34.910
<i>He is obedient and hides nothing from me.</i>

00:14:34.990 --> 00:14:36.330
Don't be nosy if you don't want to die.

00:14:36.950 --> 00:14:39.500
-Judgement Knights of Thunder!
<i>-And he has a big heart.</i>

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:41.210
<i>Who the hell is she talking about?</i>

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:42.750
But that's not enough.

00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:44.800
-He should study more.
-Don't worry.

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:46.260
<i>You should worry.</i>

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:49.130
You can say so because your son is smart.

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:51.390
<i>-Wrong.</i>
-Mrs. Saiki, why are you being quiet?

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:53.810
Is it true that your eldest son graduated
from the University of Cambridge?

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:55.100
<i>-She knew about that?</i>
-How did you know?

00:14:55.180 --> 00:14:59.060
-How did he study? Will you tell me?
-Well...

00:14:59.140 --> 00:15:00.650
I didn't do anything special...

00:15:00.730 --> 00:15:02.520
<i>Yeah, seems like she didn't.</i>

00:15:02.610 --> 00:15:03.980
<i>She didn't, as a matter of fact.</i>

00:15:04.070 --> 00:15:06.530
Let's change the topic.
What does your husband do?

00:15:06.610 --> 00:15:07.570
He is an editor.

00:15:07.650 --> 00:15:08.950
-He's working at trading company.
<i>-I'm just concerned</i>

00:15:09.030 --> 00:15:12.280
<i>-that Mom will let my secret slip.</i>
-How about you, Mrs. Nendou?

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:15.160
<i>I was concerned</i>
<i>because she has done it before.</i>

00:15:15.240 --> 00:15:18.410
-My husband works so hard.
<i>-She seems to have learned a lesson.</i>

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:21.670
<i>-No psychic, no psychic, no psychic...</i>
<i>-She's been quiet to not reveal my secret.</i>

00:15:22.420 --> 00:15:25.090
-Publishing companies must be struggling.
<i>-My secret is safe now.</i>

00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:26.630
Yeah, they almost went bankrupt,

00:15:26.710 --> 00:15:28.920
but they made it back
and are doing well now.

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:31.970
He sometimes messes it up and relies
on Ku-chan's psychic abilities to fix it.

00:15:32.050 --> 00:15:33.680
-What?
-Psychic abilities?

00:15:33.760 --> 00:15:35.140
<i>She let her guard down.</i>

00:15:35.220 --> 00:15:38.060
<i>Calm down. She can pretend</i>
<i>that she was just joking.</i>

00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:40.230
Psychic? No, I never said that.

00:15:40.310 --> 00:15:42.560
<i>She's making it so real.</i>
<i>Well, I have no choice.</i>

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:46.520
Yeah, like I said, Ku-chan is a psychic.

00:15:46.610 --> 00:15:47.480
-What?
-You're not kidding?

00:15:47.570 --> 00:15:48.570
SCI-KICK
PSYCHIC

00:15:48.650 --> 00:15:50.780
It's "sci-kick." He's a science genius.

00:15:50.860 --> 00:15:53.450
And I'm talking about Kusuke, not Kusuo.

00:15:53.530 --> 00:15:54.870
"Sci-kick"?

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:56.330
I've never heard of it.

00:15:57.200 --> 00:15:58.080
SENTENCE SPRING
THE WORLD TOP 100 SCI-KICKS

00:15:58.160 --> 00:16:00.580
<i>Ayumi, did you break up</i>
<i>with your sci-kick boyfriend?</i>

00:16:00.660 --> 00:16:03.000
<i>Yeah, because I don't understand</i>
<i>what he's talking about.</i>

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:06.000
It's a trend word. I often hear it on TV.

00:16:06.090 --> 00:16:08.500
-I didn't know that.
-Is it a synonym for genius?

00:16:08.590 --> 00:16:09.840
Oh, I have to go now.

00:16:09.920 --> 00:16:12.680
-It's time to open my shop, too.
-See you, then.

00:16:12.760 --> 00:16:15.090
Please introduce your sci-kick son
to us next time.

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:16.050
Have a good evening.

00:16:16.140 --> 00:16:17.640
Thank you! See you!

00:16:18.680 --> 00:16:20.520
<i>Oh, well. I should erase their memories,</i>
<i>just in case.</i>

00:16:20.600 --> 00:16:24.100
I'm sorry!
I'm not good at keeping secrets.

00:16:24.190 --> 00:16:28.820
I was not going to talk about you,
but I was excited to have mom friends.

00:16:28.900 --> 00:16:31.110
<i>It's not her fault.</i>
<i>I've been forcing her to do that.</i>

00:16:31.780 --> 00:16:32.610
Ku-chan?

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:35.490
<i>I am the one who was saved</i>
<i>and should thank her.</i>

00:16:36.070 --> 00:16:41.000
LET'S SHOW OUR PROUD CLAY WORK

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:42.910
"ART BEGINS AND ENDS
WITH SELF EXPRESSION."

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:43.830
SOSEKI NATSUME

00:16:44.460 --> 00:16:46.040
Clay work is due today.

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:48.420
If you haven't finished,
finish it by the end of class.

00:16:48.500 --> 00:16:50.630
-Have you finished?
-Shoot! I can't make it.

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:52.550
-I'm done.
-Oh, are you, Kaidou?

00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:54.010
WHY DID YOU MAKE THIS ARTWORK?

00:16:54.090 --> 00:16:56.590
Because it's my mission and my fate.

00:16:56.680 --> 00:17:00.060
Even beautiful angels can suddenly become
fallen angels in this world.

00:17:00.180 --> 00:17:03.600
I made it because I wanted
to convey the fear and vulnerability.

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:05.060
WHAT WAS THE HARDEST PART?

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:10.020
I struggled to express
the texture of Lucifer's broken wings.

00:17:10.110 --> 00:17:12.030
I'm satisfied with the quality.

00:17:12.110 --> 00:17:13.490
WHAT IS THE TITLE OF YOUR ARTWORK?

00:17:13.570 --> 00:17:15.450
<i>Fallen Lucifer.</i>

00:17:15.530 --> 00:17:22.410
LOT NUMBER 1
FALLEN LUCIFER BY SHUN KAIDOU

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:25.870
Wow, did you turn in the work
you dropped on the floor as is?

00:17:25.960 --> 00:17:27.210
I didn't drop it!

00:17:27.290 --> 00:17:29.590
-"Dropped Lucifer"?
-I'm done, too!

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:30.800
WHY DID YOU MAKE THIS ARTWORK?

00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:33.260
I just made what I like. That's all.

00:17:33.340 --> 00:17:34.470
WHAT IS THE MESSAGE OF YOUR ARTWORK?

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:38.800
I have filled it with the dreams of men.

00:17:38.890 --> 00:17:43.350
However, some people may feel
fear, anxiety and frustration.

00:17:43.810 --> 00:17:47.190
Dreams come true
because of someone's sacrifice.

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:48.400
WHAT IS THE TITLE OF YOUR ARTWORK?

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:49.360
<i>Dream.</i>

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:55.360
LOT NUMBER 2
DREAM BY AREN KUBOYASU

00:17:55.440 --> 00:17:57.280
This is amazing, Aren!

00:17:57.360 --> 00:17:58.990
-Isn't it? I worked so hard.
<i>-It is amazing,</i>

00:17:59.070 --> 00:18:01.740
<i>-but you'll lose points with the title.</i>
-Place it next to mine!

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:02.950
<i>Lucifer Run Over.</i>

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:04.910
-I'm done, too!
<i>-Your hand!</i>

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:06.000
WHY DID YOU MAKE THIS ARTWORK?

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:07.830
Oh, I don't know.

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:09.330
My hands made it without my will.

00:18:09.420 --> 00:18:10.420
WHAT WAS THE HARDEST PART?

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:14.170
There's a vent blowing cold air
directly at my seat.

00:18:14.260 --> 00:18:15.630
That was the hardest part.

00:18:15.720 --> 00:18:16.720
WHAT IS THE MESSAGE OF YOUR ARTWORK?

00:18:16.800 --> 00:18:18.050
What the hell do you mean?

00:18:18.130 --> 00:18:20.390
It's all up to you.

00:18:20.470 --> 00:18:22.310
<i>He looks like an artist somehow.</i>

00:18:22.390 --> 00:18:28.230
LOT NUMBER 3
NO TITLE BY RIKI NENDOU

00:18:28.310 --> 00:18:30.730
-Who is that?
-Who knows.

00:18:30.810 --> 00:18:33.400
I told you that my hands
made it without my will.

00:18:33.480 --> 00:18:35.400
If that's true, it's a horror!

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:36.440
Go to see a doctor!

00:18:36.530 --> 00:18:37.400
I'm done!

00:18:37.490 --> 00:18:38.490
WHY DID YOU MAKE THIS ARTWORK?

00:18:38.570 --> 00:18:42.240
Because I wanted
to show my passion for art.

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:43.330
WHAT WAS THE HARDEST PART?

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:46.790
<i>I was working wearing ten-kilogram weights</i>
<i>on my arms. That was the hardest part.</i>

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:47.870
WHAT IS THE MESSAGE OF YOUR ARTWORK?

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:50.790
I made it with the wish
of achieving calmness of heart.

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:52.210
LOT NUMBER 4
CALM BY KINESHI HAIRO

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:53.920
<i>Lot number 4! </i>Calm!

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:55.210
<i>Kineshi Hairo!</i>

00:18:55.880 --> 00:18:57.510
<i>Yeah, it's so Hairo.</i>

00:18:57.590 --> 00:18:58.840
How about I'm done!

00:18:58.920 --> 00:18:59.930
WHY DID YOU MAKE THIS ARTWORK?

00:19:00.010 --> 00:19:02.010
I don't know. 'Cause it was an assignment?

00:19:02.090 --> 00:19:03.100
WHAT WAS THE HARDEST PART?

00:19:03.180 --> 00:19:05.930
I don't like to work hard,
so I just enjoyed making it.

00:19:06.020 --> 00:19:07.020
WHAT IS THE MESSAGE OF YOUR ARTWORK?

00:19:07.100 --> 00:19:08.350
Who cares?

00:19:08.430 --> 00:19:14.110
LOT NUMBER 5
DECOR BY MIKOTO AIURA

00:19:14.190 --> 00:19:15.570
<i>I thought we could only use clay.</i>

00:19:15.650 --> 00:19:16.780
I'm done.

00:19:16.860 --> 00:19:18.110
WHY DID YOU MAKE THIS ARTWORK?

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:19.530
The title is <i>Wish.</i>

00:19:19.610 --> 00:19:24.080
I made it wishing that every student
at PK Academy becomes a friend.

00:19:24.160 --> 00:19:26.700
<i>Wishing they can overcome any problems</i>
<i>by helping each other.</i>

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:28.910
LOT NUMBER 6
WISH BY KOKOMI TERUHASHI

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:30.540
<i>Wow, you're amazing, Teruhashi-san!</i>

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:32.420
Let us take a closer look at it!

00:19:32.500 --> 00:19:33.960
And become close to me!

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:36.500
-Me, too!
-No! Please! The bottom part is unstable.

00:19:43.300 --> 00:19:45.180
<i>Oh, no!</i>

00:19:45.390 --> 00:19:46.390
WHY DID YOU DO THAT?

00:19:46.470 --> 00:19:47.770
I just wanted to take a closer look.

00:19:47.850 --> 00:19:49.560
I feel really sorry for her artwork.

00:19:49.640 --> 00:19:50.890
<i>Don't apologize like it's an interview.</i>

00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:52.190
WHY DID YOU MAKE THIS ARTWORK?

00:19:52.270 --> 00:19:56.110
Of course, I meant to apologize,
but it was simply fun to make.

00:19:56.190 --> 00:19:57.570
Something invisible.

00:19:57.650 --> 00:19:58.530
The theme is "Light."

00:19:58.730 --> 00:20:01.110
I just moved my hands on impulse.

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:03.070
Wishing the world peace.

00:20:03.160 --> 00:20:04.530
This is my dream.

00:20:04.620 --> 00:20:05.910
NUMBER 7 GODDESS
NUMBER 8 LOVE

00:20:05.990 --> 00:20:06.830
NUMBER 9 LIGHT

00:20:06.910 --> 00:20:08.160
NUMBER 10 MY LOVE IS SELFISH
BUT I WILL NEVER HURT ONLY YOU

00:20:08.240 --> 00:20:10.040
NUMBER 11 WORLD PEACE
NUMBER 12 ANGELS LANDING AT THE BASEMENT

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:12.210
-Creepy...
-No, this is a complete failure.

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:13.920
It doesn't look like Teruhashi-san.

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:16.420
-More!
-This is not Teruhashi-san!

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:17.840
This is terrible!

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:19.170
This is a flop!

00:20:21.590 --> 00:20:22.880
<i>Oh, well. A bunch of idiots.</i>

00:20:22.970 --> 00:20:24.470
WHY DID YOU MAKE THIS ARTWORK?

00:20:24.550 --> 00:20:26.550
<i>Oh, it's my turn at last.</i>

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:31.600
LOT NUMBER 16
COMPLETION BY KUSUO SAIKI

00:20:31.680 --> 00:20:34.310
<i>-What? Did you build that part?</i>
<i>-Why should I?</i>

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:36.810
<i>-What? It's done?</i>
<i>-Oh, my mistake.</i>

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:37.770
<i>-What the...</i>
<i>-Huh?</i>

00:20:37.860 --> 00:20:40.150
<i>Oh, well, I built too much</i>
<i>before I knew it.</i>

00:22:09.030 --> 00:22:11.030
Subtitle translation by Kanako Murakoshi
